                        ],
                        "form": "богаде́льнях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad00e8fc-a9b4-3e45-8a2e-edee77c1e068",
                        "entry_id": "0ef4e2f2-69f6-38b4-bbc8-c7d196caa8e1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. приют для престарелых и инвалидов (в дореволюционной России)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5aca56e7-2415-4049-9366-1b85de5d12bf",
                                "sense_id": "ad00e8fc-a9b4-3e45-8a2e-edee77c1e068",
                                "text": "Купец суконным товаром Кофман когда-то воздвиг в память жены своей Изабеллы богадельню рядом с кладбищенской стеной."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2531a73-4885-3a75-871b-be32cd192e78",
                        "entry_id": "0ef4e2f2-69f6-38b4-bbc8-c7d196caa8e1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. разг. учреждение, заведение, в котором работает большое количество бездеятельных, неспособных людей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1e2935b9-ad5c-4bb4-b299-f0cfd05c9b3d",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ef4e2f2-69f6-38b4-bbc8-c7d196caa8e1",
                        "source_sense_description": "приют для престарелых и инвалидов",
                        "target_lang_word": "almshouse",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "almshouse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35c3c2dc-2c41-31c3-9121-f2065ab23440",
                                        "entry_id": "3146ebf8-8b4d-3783-a4e4-e6494ff203c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A building of residence for the poor, sick or elderly of a parish. Originally founded by the Church, and usually funded by charitable donations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa08ab28-4429-4792-a619-cc7624ddff55",
                                                "sense_id": "35c3c2dc-2c41-31c3-9121-f2065ab23440",
                                                "text": "Much they saw, and far they went, and many homes they visited, but always with a happy end. The Spirit stood beside sick beds, and they were cheerful; on foreign lands, and they were close at home; by struggling men, and they were patient in their greater hope; by poverty, and it was rich. In almshouse, hospital, and jail, in misery's every refuge, where vain man in his little brief authority had not made fast the door, and barred the Spirit out, he left his blessing, and taught Scrooge his precepts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c21bc1d2-27c7-4f90-8471-de965deee368",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ef4e2f2-69f6-38b4-bbc8-c7d196caa8e1",
                        "source_sense_description": "приют для престарелых и инвалидов",
                        "target_lang_word": "hospice",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hospice",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "640c312d-f9f1-30bd-9973-54cc5ced6765",
                                        "entry_id": "4271c055-084b-3e11-ae47-d9c6f8972cec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lodging for pilgrims or the destitute, normally provided by a monastic order."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f4d9396-bfbd-4f4d-9a04-b0af427851fd",
                                                "sense_id": "640c312d-f9f1-30bd-9973-54cc5ced6765",
                                                "text": "At the west end of the street is the ruined 13th-century hospice, known locally as Pilgrims' Rest. It was built by Bishop Beck for the use of travellers, and was used as place of rest by pilgrims on their way from Bardsey Island to St David's Cathedral."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86e280b8-363e-3014-9af2-1c21884108fc",
                                        "entry_id": "4271c055-084b-3e11-ae47-d9c6f8972cec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The provision of palliative care for terminally ill patients, either at a specialized facility or at a residence, and support for the family, typically refraining from taking extraordinary measures to prolong life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b4875bd-99c7-43f2-8ec0-42d32ccaa15b",
                                                "sense_id": "86e280b8-363e-3014-9af2-1c21884108fc",
                                                "text": "The modern concept of hospice and palliative nursing has its roots in the hospice movement. Introduced to the United States in the early 1960s, hospice has grown from one organization in 1971 to more than 3500 organizations in 2001."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8308e397-1ac7-4011-b26a-a0355d93d913",
                                                "sense_id": "86e280b8-363e-3014-9af2-1c21884108fc",
                                                "text": "Thus, the introduction of hospice services marked a new beginning, not only for the care of the dying, but also for the practice of medicine as a whole."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22f8c69c-40ba-401c-91dc-c99837ff8f1f",
                                                "sense_id": "86e280b8-363e-3014-9af2-1c21884108fc",
                                                "text": "With the emergence of the modern hospice movement and its institutionalization in the 1970s, however, the religious dimension of hospice moved considerably away from its Christian roots. While it is widely agreed that hospice ought to be concerned with the spiritual needs of the dying, how to do this in a pluralistic society is far from clear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e139f374-b735-4224-a945-129e650cc203",
                                                "sense_id": "86e280b8-363e-3014-9af2-1c21884108fc",
                                                "text": "Former President Jimmy Carter, who at 98 is the longest living president in American history, has decided to forgo further medical treatment and will enter hospice care at his home in Georgia, the Carter Center announced on Saturday."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "beddc8a1-df79-3055-ad00-4666ca090869",
                                        "entry_id": "4271c055-084b-3e11-ae47-d9c6f8972cec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A specialized facility or organization offering palliative care for the terminally ill."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2eb8b40e-f1db-4464-b723-331a3857200b",
                                                "sense_id": "beddc8a1-df79-3055-ad00-4666ca090869",
                                                "text": "Medicare reimbursement of hospice care is likely to be affected by the apparent reluctance of hospices to participate in the Medicare program."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d9fb072-cc36-4eba-9ae3-4e0873b07f3c",
                                                "sense_id": "beddc8a1-df79-3055-ad00-4666ca090869",
                                                "text": "A small number of hospices were opened in the US in the 1890s, but these institutions differed from the hospices that came into being in the second part of the twentieth century in the following ways."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "631b4b2b-f829-4dea-b304-36fcfbb772da",
                                                "sense_id": "beddc8a1-df79-3055-ad00-4666ca090869",
                                                "text": "St Joseph's Hospice Association in Liverpool supports hospices in Guatemala, Honduras, Ecuador and Peru, as well as having links with hospices in India, Pakistan and Mexico that bear the same name."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5c1caf7-cbbf-4e45-b360-5a9be6e65962",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ef4e2f2-69f6-38b4-bbc8-c7d196caa8e1",
                        "source_sense_description": "приют для престарелых и инвалидов",
                        "target_lang_word": "Armenhaus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Armenhaus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32412dc8-206b-39ec-821f-afd3419ef757",
                                        "entry_id": "4f36232e-59e0-3cae-b44d-611c08f51fbc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unterkunft für Bedürftige"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4672b78b-e85f-4c42-9974-9da2cb51f8c5",
                                                "sense_id": "32412dc8-206b-39ec-821f-afd3419ef757",
                                                "text": "Sie brachten die Familie im Armenhaus unter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7eeaf40f-0fce-4378-af8e-4e4f5b1bf4d4",
                                                "sense_id": "32412dc8-206b-39ec-821f-afd3419ef757",
                                                "text": "„So als habe man sie gerade aus dem Kittchen oder dem Armenhaus entlassen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8340ff37-e88f-41cc-876a-52520c20604b",
                                                "sense_id": "32412dc8-206b-39ec-821f-afd3419ef757",
                                                "text": "„Nur an seinem Ende, beim Armenhause und der Irrenanstalt standen einige kleine Gruppen in weissen Kitteln herum, und einige ebenso gekleidete Leute gingen über das Feld, schrien und fuchtelten mit den Armen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                        "entry_id": "4f36232e-59e0-3cae-b44d-611c08f51fbc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gebiet eines Landes/Kontinents/einer Region, das/die sich wirtschaftlich unterdurchschnittlich entwickelt (beispielsweise könnte es ein geringes Wachstum/BIP haben)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "932d31a0-750a-4676-8e48-7a180d46ae99",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "„Trotzdem bleibt Süditalien lange Zeit das Armenhaus des Landes, und viele wandern nach Amerika aus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c8c0b1d-0cda-4e3d-8b93-cd53c1624435",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "„Kaum eine Gegend in Europa hat in den vergangenen Jahrzehnten einen derartigen Aufstieg erlebt wie Südtirol - vom einstigen Armenhaus zur prosperierenden Region.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30827b7b-b4ff-4916-8e5f-52398176038c",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "[Schlagzeile:] „Vietnam: Vom Armenhaus zum Wirtschaftswunder“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c02a5298-ed69-4b7f-b163-7644de9b3465",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "„Haiti ist ein Armenhaus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8e6f6c2-47b2-4830-b176-51a413e2c2cd",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "Wenig Industrie, schlechte Böden: Der Landesteil [Anmerkung: Wales] mit seinen etwa drei Millionen Einwohnern wird auch Armenhaus des Vereinigten Königreichs genannt […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2db11e1e-dce5-4438-8fc3-b2aea72da007",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "„In Libyen droht der Staatszerfall, im Jemen, dem arabischen Armenhaus, sprechen die Vereinten Nationen heute von der größten humanitären Katastrophe der Welt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfa496fe-eba5-4787-858c-7b579106db56",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "„Das von Maduro mit harter Hand regierte Venezuela hat zwar die größten Ölreserven der Welt, ist aber zum Armenhaus Südamerikas mutiert.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cd924b8-a936-41d3-8c0b-08d5bb833772",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "[Simbabwe und sein Ex-Staatschef Robert Mugabe:] „Unter seiner Führung war aus der einstigen Kornkammer der Region ein Armenhaus geworden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac959c13-1de6-4353-8f7e-5864ac8a9a42",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7c21d-367d-3de1-8a82-efc0d1535443",
                                                "text": "„Früher galt Puerto Rico als Juwel der Karibik, als Sehnsuchtsort. Diese Zeiten sind vorbei. Heute ist die Insel ein Armenhaus.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
